    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </header>
  <p class="meta">Offline Expense Tracker-Budget (Android) · Effective 20 October 2026</p>

  <div class="summary">
    <p><strong>In short:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Everything you enter stays on your phone.</li>
      <li>We collect no personal data and share no data with anyone.</li>
      <li>No account, no sign-up, no ads, no analytics, no tracking.</li>
      <li>The app does not use the internet at all.</li>
    </ul>
